\\") \\\"RC0805FR-0710K7L\\\")\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source\": \"spice\",\n          \"quote\": \"R29 0 /VREFNB 10.7Meg\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source\": \"netlist\",\n          \"quote\": \"(comp (ref \\\"R27\\\") (value \\\"10k7\\\")\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"The 1000\u00d7 larger lower-leg resistance drives U7's VREF close to its 5VOUT rail instead of setting the intended divider voltage. This can cause an excessive motor-current setting or put the reference outside its intended range, risking incorrect operation or damage to the Nutrient-B pump driver and motor.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.98\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"Anomaly detected. The regulator enable is left unconnected, likely preventing the board's power rails from starting, and R29 is 1000\u00d7 larger than its listed part number and matching VREF-divider value.\"\n}",
